      "kind": "paper",
      "note": "SELECT2REASON selects the top 10% of a large long-CoT instruction pool for SFT by jointly ranking questions on a learned difficulty score and (deduplicated) reasoning-trace length, matching or beating models trained on 8-94x more data.",
